---
import InfoPage from '../components/InfoPage.astro';
---
<InfoPage
  title="Privacy"
  description="How iLoveMyFiles handles files, browser data, and information when you use this website."
  canonical="/privacy/"
>
  <section aria-labelledby="privacy-files">
    <h2 id="privacy-files">Files and tools</h2>
    <p>How a file is processed depends on the tool. Many tools process files in your browser, while some features may use an online service or request external data. Check the individual tool for its processing details before selecting a file, especially if it contains sensitive information.</p>
    <p>Game scores and some preferences may be stored in your browser. You can clear this data using your browser's site-data settings.</p>
  </section>
  <section aria-labelledby="privacy-site">
    <h2 id="privacy-site">Website and third-party services</h2>
    <p>Our hosting and delivery providers may process technical information needed to serve and protect the website. This site also loads Google advertising services; Google may use cookies or similar technologies under its own policies and settings.</p>
    <p>When you email us, your message and email address are handled by the email services involved in sending and receiving it. We use that information to respond to your enquiry.</p>
  </section>
  <section aria-labelledby="privacy-contact">
    <h2 id="privacy-contact">Questions</h2>
    <p>For privacy questions, contact <a href="mailto:ilovemyfiles.com@gmail.com">ilovemyfiles.com@gmail.com</a>.</p>
  </section>
</InfoPage>
